# Debug

Use this skill for reproduce-first troubleshooting.

## Protocol

1. Establish the failing behavior with evidence.
2. Isolate the smallest reproducible scope.
3. Fix only after reproducing or building a strong evidence chain.
4. Re-run the smallest relevant canonical verification command.
